---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: 'Project Planning & Consulting',
  provider: { '@type': 'GeneralContractor', '@id': 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/#business', name: 'Purpose Construction', url: 'https://www.purposeconstructionco.com/' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'State', name: 'Texas', containedInPlace: { '@type': 'Country', name: 'United States' } },
  description: 'Project planning and consulting for East Texas homeowners: scope, budget, timeline, permit guidance, and contractor coordination for construction and remodeling projects.',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Project Planning in Lufkin, TX | Purpose Construction"
  description="Construction project planning in Lufkin, TX: scope, budget, timeline and permit guidance before you build or remodel. Call (936) 255-2235."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services/' }, { label: 'Project Planning & Consulting', href: '/project-planning-consulting/' }]} />
  <PageHero title="Construction Project Planning in Lufkin, TX" subtitle="Know what your project involves, what it costs, and how to get from idea to finished build before you ever break ground." tag="General Service" 
    image="/images/project-planning-consulting-east-texas.jpg"
  />

  <section class="section-padding bg-warm-50">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
        <div>
          <SectionHeading tag="Project Planning" title="The Clarity You Need Before Construction Starts" />
          <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">
            <p>Most construction problems start long before the first nail goes in. They start in planning, when the scope is fuzzy, the budget isn't realistic, or the homeowner doesn't really know what they're signing up for. Purpose Construction offers project planning and consulting for East Texas homeowners who want a clear plan for their build or remodel instead of figuring it out under pressure halfway through.</p>
            <p>We sit down with you, talk through what you're trying to do, and help you put together a realistic scope, a budget that holds up, and a timeline in the right order. If your project needs permits from Angelina County or the City of Lufkin, we'll tell you what's required and how the process works. If you'll have several contractors, we'll explain how the trades line up and what to look for when you compare bids and pick subs.</p>
            <p>You don't have to hire us for the build to get consulting. If you're early in planning and just want advice from someone who's done it, that's a fine use of our time. An hour of honest planning can save you months of expensive miscommunication later.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
            <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
            <a href="/services/" class="btn-outline">All Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/project-planning-consulting-east-texas-800.webp" alt="Project planning and consulting across East Texas by Purpose Construction" class="rounded-xl shadow-hero" width="640" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="What's Included" title="Planning & Consulting Services" align="center" />
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {['Scope Development', 'Budget Planning', 'Timeline Building', 'Permit Guidance', 'Contractor Coordination', 'Material Sourcing', 'Site Assessment', 'Phased Project Planning'].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>{item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding-sm bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="container-wide px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading tag="Related Services" title="Related Services" />
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[{ label: 'Site Preparation', href: '/site-preparation/' }, { label: 'All Services', href: '/services/' }].map(link => (
          <a href={link.href} class="rounded-lg border border-warm-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal-700 shadow-card hover:border-brand-red-mid hover:text-charcoal-900 transition-all duration-200">{link.label} →</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-red">
    <div class="container-mid px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="display-md text-white mb-4">Start With a Conversation</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-base text-white/80">Contact Purpose Construction to schedule a project planning consultation. We help East Texas homeowners start their projects with a real plan.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-ghost px-8 py-4">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:9362552235" class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150">(936) 255-2235</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
